{
  "chip_id": "clients.settings",
  "kind": "accessor",
  "set": "clients",
  "label": "Client master: statuses, PAN and GSTIN shapes, forms, years and stages",
  "aliases": [
    "clients settings"
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "statuses",
      "type": "rows",
      "default": [
        {
          "id": "individual",
          "label": "Individual",
          "pan_letter": "P",
          "form": "ITR-3",
          "has_partners": false
        },
        {
          "id": "huf",
          "label": "HUF",
          "pan_letter": "H",
          "form": "ITR-3",
          "has_partners": false
        },
        {
          "id": "firm",
          "label": "Partnership firm",
          "pan_letter": "F",
          "form": "ITR-5",
          "has_partners": true
        },
        {
          "id": "llp",
          "label": "LLP",
          "pan_letter": "F",
          "form": "ITR-5",
          "has_partners": true
        },
        {
          "id": "aop",
          "label": "AOP",
          "pan_letter": "A",
          "form": "ITR-5",
          "has_partners": true
        },
        {
          "id": "boi",
          "label": "BOI",
          "pan_letter": "B",
          "form": "ITR-5",
          "has_partners": true
        },
        {
          "id": "company",
          "label": "Company (domestic)",
          "pan_letter": "C",
          "form": "ITR-6",
          "has_partners": false,
          "has_company": true
        }
      ],
      "label": "statuses"
    },
    {
      "name": "forms",
      "type": "list",
      "default": [
        "ITR-1",
        "ITR-2",
        "ITR-3",
        "ITR-4",
        "ITR-5",
        "ITR-6"
      ],
      "label": "forms"
    },
    {
      "name": "current_ay",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "2026-27",
      "label": "current ay"
    },
    {
      "name": "years",
      "type": "list",
      "default": [
        "2023-24",
        "2024-25",
        "2025-26",
        "2026-27",
        "2027-28"
      ],
      "label": "years"
    },
    {
      "name": "stages",
      "type": "rows",
      "default": [
        {
          "id": "collecting",
          "label": "1 Collecting",
          "tag": "tag",
          "color": "--muted"
        },
        {
          "id": "mapping",
          "label": "2 Mapping",
          "tag": "tag",
          "color": "--brand-2"
        },
        {
          "id": "reconciling",
          "label": "3 Reconciling",
          "tag": "tag warn",
          "color": "--warn"
        },
        {
          "id": "review",
          "label": "4 Review",
          "tag": "tag brand",
          "color": "--brand"
        },
        {
          "id": "signed",
          "label": "5 Signed off",
          "tag": "tag brand",
          "color": "--brand"
        },
        {
          "id": "filed",
          "label": "6 Filed",
          "tag": "tag ok",
          "color": "--ok"
        }
      ],
      "label": "stages"
    },
    {
      "name": "max_len",
      "type": "json",
      "default": {
        "name": 120,
        "relation": 120,
        "address": 400,
        "email": 120,
        "phone": 30,
        "bank_field": 60,
        "partner_name": 120,
        "share": 10,
        "notes": 1000,
        "year_field": 60,
        "party_name": 125,
        "party_address": 150,
        "party_relation": 100,
        "party_mode": 6
      },
      "label": "max len"
    },
    {
      "name": "bulk_max",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 500,
      "label": "most clients one Archive / Restore press may move"
    },
    {
      "name": "with_parent",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "client",
      "label": "a filing archived BECAUSE its client was - Restore of the client brings exactly these back"
    },
    {
      "name": "party_name_drop",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "(?i)^\\s*(sri|smt|shri|shrimati|mr|mrs|ms|miss|dr|m/s)\\.?\\s+",
      "label": "party name drop"
    }
  ],
  "expr": {
    "vop": "record",
    "fields": {
      "statuses": "$statuses",
      "forms": "$forms",
      "current_ay": "$current_ay",
      "years": "$years",
      "stages": "$stages",
      "max_len": "$max_len",
      "bulk_max": "$bulk_max",
      "with_parent": "$with_parent",
      "party_name_drop": "$party_name_drop"
    }
  },
  "returns": "record",
  "version": 3,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "Which statuses an assessee can have (with the PAN 4th letter and the ITR form each files), the PAN / GSTIN / IFSC shapes, the assessment years on offer and the stages a year moves through. An LLP's PAN carries F, like a firm. 2026-10-04 owner: \"multi select and move to Archive; archive a client -> all its filings; archive a filing alone -> the client stays; parent archived -> child archived\". 2026-10-05 owner (3CD from a party master: \"we need to input 30-40 names, addresses and PANs\"): each client keeps a party master - lenders, payees, relatives - with name, address, PAN, relationship and usual payment mode; the party fields fit the Form 3CD schema (name 125, address 150). party_name_drop: honorifics a statement may put before a name, ignored when matching a party by name. 2026-10-11: status company - a domestic company (PAN 4th letter C) files ITR-6; has_company: the client carries a company part (CIN, date of incorporation, kind, tax option, listed, manufacturing, key persons, shareholders) - company.py, chip company.settings / company.problem. 2026-10-19 owner (My return read an ITR-2 the import refused): ITR-1, ITR-2 and ITR-4 import too.",
